<h3>Objective</h3>
<p>This exercise involved selecting a data visualisation from HowMuch.net, tracking down its original data source, verifying the accuracy of the values presented, and examining the quality of the source data. The goal was to practice critical data verification skills and identify potential discrepancies or limitations in published data visualisations.</p>

